<title>USA: Helix group cuts Hummingbird stake.</title>
<headline>Helix group cuts Hummingbird stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Helix Investments (Canada) Inc said Friday it reduced its stake in Hummingbird Communications Ltd to 8.7 percent or 1,192,415 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 250,000 shares of Hummingbird on November 6 for $29.39 a share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake for investment. It said the stake includes 23,666 shares it may acquire on exercise of options.</p>
</text>
